<title>USA: Alrenco files for 1.5 million share offer.</title>
<headline>Alrenco files for 1.5 million share offer.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ALBANY, Ind. 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alrenco Inc said Friday it filed a registration statement to offer 1.5 million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>Proceeds will be used to pay debt, to fund possible future acquisitions and for other general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>Managing underwriters for the offering are Equitable Securities Corp, Wheat First Butcher Singer and J.J.B. Hilliard W.L. Lyons Inc.</p>
<p>Alrenco, which went public in January, operates 119 rental-purchase stores in 15 states.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
